head\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(22年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"61.7\" width=\"320\" height=\"7.200000000000003\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,64.6 9.1,66.0 14.2,68.4 19.3,67.0 24.5,64.6 29.6,68.9 34.7,85.2 39.8,92.0 44.9,90.0 50.0,92.4 55.1,91.5 60.3,94.8 65.4,97.2 70.5,90.0 75.6,95.8 80.7,95.8 85.8,93.9 91.0,88.6 96.1,75.2 101.2,79.5 106.3,83.3 111.4,77.6 116.5,70.4 121.6,67.0 126.8,69.4 131.9,42.0 137.0,33.9 142.1,41.6 147.2,50.7 152.3,51.2 157.4,24.8 162.6,45.4 167.7,38.7 172.8,26.7 177.9,12.8 183.0,28.6 188.1,37.2 193.2,40.6 198.4,44.0 203.5,28.6 208.6,29.1 213.7,31.0 218.8,50.7 223.9,42.0 229.0,54.0 234.2,56.9 239.3,54.0 244.4,60.3 249.5,58.8 254.6,65.1 259.7,72.3 264.9,68.4 270.0,63.6 275.1,53.6 280.2,46.4 285.3,56.0 290.4,50.7 295.5,35.8 300.7,39.2 305.8,31.5 310.9,41.1 316.0,46.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 76.6 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 76.6 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 76.6 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 76.6 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 152.3 63.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 218.8 62.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"46.8\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c